---
import H from "@/components/H.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Section from "@/components/Section.astro";
---

<Layout title="FRC 12148">
    <H class="mb-4">
        Team V.A.N.
    </H>

    <p>Student-led FIRST Robotics Competition (FRC) Team.</p>

    <Section>
        <H level="h2">What we do</H>
        <p>
            Founded in 2026, Team V.A.N. is dedicated to giving students
            hands-on experience in engineering, problem solving, and most
            importantly, decisionmaking and leadership.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our goal is to allow students to control and manage every aspect of
            the team, from the sponsorships and fundraising to critical design
            decisions of the robot.
        </p>
        <p>
            In our team, students learn how to design, build, and program
            industrial-size robots while developing business, marketing, and
            presentation skills.
        </p>
        <p>
            Moreover, due to being based out of Palm Bay, we are the only FRC
            team to serve Indian River County.
        </p>

        <H level="h2">
            <a
                href="/interest/"
                class="text-inherit underline decoration-silver underline-offset-4"
            >Join us</a>
        </H>
        <p>
            We are always looking for passionate students to join our team.
            Whether you're interested in the engineering or business side of
            things, we can always use another hand, no matter your experience.
        </p>
        <H level="h2">Want to be a mentor?</H>
        <p>
            Experienced individuals who want to guide and support our students
            are encouraged to reach out. If you have expertise in mechanics,
            electronics, business, or any other relevant field, we would love to
            have you on board as a mentor.
            <br />
            Shoot us an email at{" "}
            <a
                href="mailto:contact@teamvan.org"
                class="text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-4"
            >
                contact@teamvan.org
            </a>
            .
        </p>
    </Section>
</Layout>
